@startuml
!include style.iuml
title Diagrama de Classes 3 — App Flutter: modelos de domínio persistidos localmente (lib/screens) — parte A
hide empty members
package "Registro emocional (US-06, US-07, US-10)" as P1 {
  class EmotionalEntry {
    + id : String
    + date : DateTime
    + emoji : String
    + label : String
    + escala : int [1..10]
    + colorHex : String
    + nota : String
    + toJson() / fromJson()
    + relativeDateLabel : String
  }
  class EmotionalEntryStorage {
    + {static} loadAll() : Future<List<EmotionalEntry>>
    + {static} add(entry)
    + {static} clearAll()
  }
  class EmotionalInsights {
    + last7Days / last30Days
    + weeklyAverage : double
    + weeklyTrend : double
    + suggestions : List<String>
  }
}
package "Gamificação (US-03, US-12, US-13)" as P2 {
  class GamificationStatus {
    + xp : int
    + streakDays : int
    + totalMissionsCompleted : int
    + lastCompletionDate : DateTime?
    + unlockedBadgeIds : Set<String>
    + level : int = xp / 100 + 1
    + completeMission(id) : Set<String>
    + resetDailyMissionsIfNeeded()
    + save() / load()
  }
  class Mission {
    + id : String
    + title : String
    + xpReward : int
    + completed : bool
  }
  class BadgeInfo {
    + id : String
    + title : String
    + unlockCondition : bool Function(GamificationStatus)
  }
  class PetStatus {
    + hunger : double [0..100]
    + happiness : double [0..100]
    + energy : double [0..100]
    + mood : String
    + save() / load()
  }
}
EmotionalEntryStorage "1" o-- "*" EmotionalEntry
EmotionalInsights --> "*" EmotionalEntry
GamificationStatus "1" *-- "4" Mission
GamificationStatus ..> BadgeInfo : kBadgeCatalog (5)
note "Estas classes persistem os dados no dispositivo via\n**SharedPreferences** (save()/load() ou classes *Storage).\nNesta versão não há chamada ao backend para esses dados." as N
@enduml
